The files under src-rust/kagg-engine/src/ are a derivative work of
kaggle_environments/envs/kaggriculture/kaggriculture.py (release 1.32.7):
the game rules, constants, price curves and step order are reproduced from
it. kaggle-environments itself is not redistributed here; it is an optional
dependency used only to verify fidelity.

src-rust/kagg-engine/src/mt19937.rs is an independent Rust implementation of
the Mersenne Twister MT19937 algorithm by Makoto Matsumoto and Takuji
Nishimura (including the `init_by_array` seeding of mt19937ar), written to
reproduce the output of CPython's `random` module bit for bit.
